  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET MVC Circular Gauge control is used to display numerical values on a circular scale with a rich set of customization options. It supports features like multiple axes, multiple pointers (needle, range bar, marker), gradient colors, ranges, ticks, labels, tooltips, animation, and annotations. It is widely used in dashboards for representing speedometers, tachometers, clocks, radial sliders, and other gauge-style KPI metrics in ASP.NET MVC applications.",
